4) Add Kubernetes Package Repository
=============================================

Download the public signing key for the Kubernetes package repository using curl command.

# curl -fsSL https://pkgs.k8s.io/core:/stable:/v1.36/deb/Release.key | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /etc/apt/keyrings/k8s.gpg

https://kubernetes.io/releases/
curl -L -s https://dl.k8s.io/release/stable.txt

# echo 'deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/k8s.gpg] https://pkgs.k8s.io/core:/stable:/v1.36/deb/ /' | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/k8s.list


